cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "TitanHydroPy: an open-source nonlinear shallow-water framework for barometrically forced long waves in Titan's hydrocarbon seas (Paper 1 code snapshot)"
abstract: >-
  Frozen, self-contained code snapshot supporting the manuscript
  "TitanHydroPy: a validated open-source nonlinear shallow-water framework
  for barometrically forced long waves in Titan's hydrocarbon seas."
  Regenerates every figure and every number reported in the paper from a
  single command, with no external data and no network access.
type: software
authors:
